    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d82">

                <pb facs="0203" n="115" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg115"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wilson to Mr.
                            Flay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-06-15"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 15, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 364.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that upon June 1
                    the President of the Republic formally opened the regular session of Congress,
                    and read upon the occasion the message which is inclosed herewith, in the
                    original text, a summary in English text accompanying.</p>
                <p>The message is noteworthy only in that it depicts very clearly the improved
                    financial condition of the country.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry Lane
                    Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d82-a1.xml" xpointer="d82-a1"/>
